#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:29
#: 4ced6daa5eca4625b0ba1da325bf1ad7 9ff05ad226a94316b380b1e9992803f9
#: d2196240f1014ff499f9467625b96d4b d8da6dde5f0d4cfd8571b6742c334e8a
#: e467801f3af1404aa093602a729e484f
msgid ""
"Because most users use an external :ref:`GPS and Compass module <common-"
"positioning-landing-page>`, an I2C splitter is recommended, such as shown "
"below. The :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` parameter should be set to "
"the controller type used."
msgstr ""
"由于大多数用户使用外置 :ref:`GPS 和罗盘模块 <common-positioning-landing-page>`，建议使用 I2C "
"分线器（如下图所示）。:ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` 参数应设置为所用控制器类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:35
#: 47745de56ad84c9f9aba034cce1de939 6b2e6cbc779342cc86bebe5505c19bde
#: 912c99f4621f49a09f8b04d6741a4d11 ab31f8d77b4045a89129175c0647c5a4
#: c04e9d05a1214fd2b0eac1f028a35776
msgid "Serially Connected Devices"
msgstr "串行连接设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:37
#: 2b0bc42274734933b22b1d93a1a28bae 3c5ec98335c944bf97ea3b4f60071df2
#: 418b6b459d1845caa43bafe25dca761e 47671b7a3c4545d19fcddc33d1c4e25c
#: 4fc78210142d4415aebabb9d33acadfd
msgid ""
"Serial LEDs connected to an output require that the output be DMA capable "
"for proper operation. If the output is DShot capable, then its DMA capable. "
"Check the autopilot's documentation to determine if the output is DShot "
"capable,"
msgstr ""
"连接到输出的串行 LED 要求该输出具备 DMA 能力以正常工作。如果该输出支持 DShot，则其具备 DMA 能力。请查阅飞控文档确认输出是否支持 "
"DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:39
#: 1af311741162484480eebbb424e6255e 4c2252e54d7d4da2bf9e2894cf0543c6
#: 5998dd2f1b484ce5b5d3a5afa22c4e34 704b8a25b9c84ae6af9f986f8a712e06
#: dd19ea55fc9e4646a5a7bbb7eea1ed62
msgid ""
"Currently, ArduPilot supports Neopixel and ProfiLED RGB LED strings on the "
"autopilot's output using ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 120 thru 123. They can be used "
"for NTF notifications from the autopilot on status and warnings like other "
"RGB LEDs, or be programmed in unlimited ways using LUA scripts on the "
"autopilot's SD card. For use with scripting the output function must be set "
"to a scripting output function (94 - 109) the script then assigns this "
"output to LEDs. See :ref:`common-lua-scripts` for more use examples using "
"LUA scripts."
msgstr ""
"目前，ArduPilot 通过 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 120 至 123 支持飞控输出上的 NeoPixel 和 ProfiLED "
"RGB LED 灯带。它们可用于飞控发出 NTF 状态和警告通知（如其他 RGB LED），也可通过飞控 SD 卡上的 LUA "
"脚本进行任意编程。如用于脚本，输出功能必须设置为脚本输出功能（94-109），脚本再将该输出分配给 LED。更多使用 LUA 脚本的示例请见 "
":ref:`common-lua-scripts`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:43
#: 352ababf13a845d380cfc9bad67c0f98 40bf5b76f6fb46e191da5d3be88566a2
#: 63784459d9c3413898ffb5497a407b0d 730b2e96dde2479ea0a3646ccfae6b6a
#: cb762e5ffda2413e803f7bb75a8a7a9d
msgid ""
"Serial LEDs require a whole pwm group, more information about your "
"autopilot's PWM groups can be found on it's :ref:`hardware page<common-"
"autopilots>`. To check that the desired outputs have been setup correctly "
"look for the PWM types message in your GCS's messages tab. See :ref:`common-"
"gpios`"
msgstr ""
"串行 LED 需要占用整个 PWM 组，有关飞控 PWM 组的更多信息请在其 :ref:`硬件页面<common-autopilots>` "
"上查阅。要确认目标输出已正确设置，请在地面站的消息选项卡中查找 PWM 类型消息。参见 :ref:`common-gpios`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:51
#: 0b63e249b3a648668fd306f22d22a5c6 48702f394379484cb32b492454064347
#: 6ed1db46760f4c8988eaf533fa6c6441 a3a0eca2d7a94426bd7437a73e00374b
#: f8ffb3bb744a4c539dda4d81a37e496e
msgid ""
"Be sure the output is configures as normal PWM instead of a GPIO output. "
"Flight controllers with a IOMCU can only use the AUX outputs for connecting "
"serial LEDs. To check that the desired outputs have been setup correctly "
"look for the PWM types message in your GCS's messages tab. See :ref:`common-"
"gpios`"
msgstr ""
"请确保输出配置为普通 PWM，而非 GPIO 输出。带有 IOMCU 的飞控只能使用 AUX 输出连接串行 "
"LED。要确认目标输出已正确设置，请在地面站的消息选项卡中查找 PWM 类型消息。参见 :ref:`common-gpios`"

